# NOTE: artifacts/ is deliberately NOT ignored. The trained .joblib files are
# copied into the image so `docker compose up` serves a working ML stack without
# a separate in-container training run; the ml_artifacts volume is seeded from
# them the first time it is created. Retrain in-container to replace them.
